          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Contact {{COACH_NAME}} — Connect for a discovery session, download a free ritual, or ask about programs in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0f0f10;--card:#0b0b0c;--muted:#aeb3b8;--accent:#c9a86b;--accent-2:#8cc0a5;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--radius:14px}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial; color:#eef0ef;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#050507 0%, #0f0f10 55%);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:28px 48px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .brand img{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:16px;margin:0;color:#fff;letter-spacing:0.4px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:22px;font-size:14px}\\n    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:0 24px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding:36px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)}\\n    .hero .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px}\\n    .hero h2{margin:0;font-size:28px;color:#fff;line-height:1.05}\\n    .hero p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}\\n    .hero .cta{margin-top:18px}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#08110f;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .panel{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .panel h3{color:#fff;margin-top:0}\\n    form .row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);color:#fff}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px}\\n    .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .mini-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);padding:16px;border-radius:12px}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}\\n    /* gallery accents */\\n    .art{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center}\\n    .art img{width:360px;max-width:100%;filter:drop-shadow(0 12px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.7))}\\n    .sections{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:26px}\\n    .section{padding:18px;background:var(--glass);border-radius:12px}\\n    .habits li{margin:8px 0}\\n    .pricing-cards{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .price{flex:1;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .price h4{margin:0;color:#fff}\\n    .lead{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .avatar{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;flex:0 0 56px}\\n    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.sections{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pricing-cards{flex-direction:column}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"{{COACH_NAME}} avatar\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Story</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Services</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Pricing</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Voices</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <!-- Hero (gallery-style) -->\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Connect • Clarify • Cultivate</div>\\n        <h2>Reach out to begin a tailored wellness journey with {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</h2>\\n        <p>Whether you want a quick diagnostic, a structured plan, or a daily micro-habit to anchor your days, start with a short conversation. No pressure — just clarity.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"cta\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a style=\\\"margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;text-decoration:none\\\" href=\\\"#diagnostic\\\">Take the 2-minute diagnostic</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"panel art\\\">\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/hero.svg\\\" alt=\\\"calm abstract gallery\\\">\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Diagnostic (brief self-assessment) -->\\n    <section id=\\\"diagnostic\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\" class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n      <h3>Two-minute alignment check</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">A quick reflective diagnostic to reveal what matters most right now. Answer honestly — there's no scoring, only insight.</p>\\n      <form action=\\\"/capture-diagnostic\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"grid-3\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"mini-card\\\">I feel rested most mornings<select name=\\\"sleep\\\"><option>Yes</option><option>Some days</option><option>Rarely</option></select></label>\\n          <label class=\\\"mini-card\\\">I have a repeatable morning ritual<select name=\\\"ritual\\\"><option>Yes</option><option>Partial</option><option>No</option></select></label>\\n          <label class=\\\"mini-card\\\">I make time for reflection<select name=\\\"reflect\\\"><option>Daily</option><option>Weekly</option><option>Almost never</option></select></label>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Reveal insights</button>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Receive a short summary and a tailored micro-habit.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </form>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Plan (program overview that ripples to Programs) -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\" class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h3>Guided Pathways</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Short, intentional coaching arcs built around habits and soulful structure. Each pathway aligns practice with measurable outcomes — resilience, restful sleep cycles, and calm productivity.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Prefer a custom mix?</div>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Explore full paths</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"pricing-cards\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">\\n          <h4>Seed — 6 weeks</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Focused habit stack, two 45-minute sessions, daily accountability prompts.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">\\n          <h4>Sprout — 12 weeks</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Structured curriculum, weekly sessions, habit audits, and an integration toolkit.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">\\n          <h4>Sanctum — 6 months</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Deep transformation container: coaching, reflective practice, and sustained habit scaffolding.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Micro-habits (concrete examples) -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\" class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n      <h3>Micro-habits — small acts, consistent change</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">Practical, spiritual-infused practices you can begin today. Pick one, repeat daily for 21 days, then add another.</p>\\n      <ul class=\\\"habits\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <li><strong>3-Minute Arrival:</strong> Before your first screen, sit, breathe to set an intention.</li>\\n        <li><strong>Signal Ritual:</strong> One deliberate action after lunch to reset energy (tea, walk, or five breaths).</li>\\n        <li><strong>Bedtime Ledger:</strong> Two notes of gratitude and one undone task release before sleep.</li>\\n      </ul>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\" class=\\\"small\\\">Download the quick guide: <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">7-Minute Daily Ritual</a></div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Pricing snapshot (ripples to pricing.html) -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\" class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h3>Investment & formats</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">Transparent pricing and flexible delivery. If you’d like a written proposal, request one in the form below.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;align-items:stretch\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">\\n          <h4>Intro Session — Single</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">60-minute discovery. Ideal for testing fit and getting a mini-plan.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">\\n          <h4>Path Bundles</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Cohort and private options available. Visit the pricing page for current rates and scholarship details.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">See full pricing</a></div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Contact form + CTA -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\" class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n          <h3>Let's schedule your discovery</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Share a few details and your preferred times. I’ll respond within 48 hours with next steps.</p>\\n          <form action=\\\"/contact\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n              <input name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required>\\n              <input name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"Phone (optional)\\\" value=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\">\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\" class=\\\"row\\\">\\n              <input name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email\\\" required value=\\\"{{EMAIL}}\\\">\\n              <select name=\\\"interest\\\"><option>Discovery session</option><option>Join a cohort</option><option>Private coaching</option></select>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n              <textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell me briefly what you're seeking (sleep, energy, routine, presence...)\\\" required></textarea>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Request a call</button>\\n              <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">Or book directly</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n        <aside style=\\\"width:300px;flex:0 0 300px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"lead panel\\\">\\n            <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"{{COACH_NAME}}\\\" class=\\\"avatar\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <div style=\\\"color:#fff;font-weight:600\\\">{{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\">Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Available globally</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\" class=\\\"panel small\\\">\\n            <strong>Quick contacts</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Phone: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Prefer a PDF proposal? Check the box in your form message.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\" class=\\\"panel small\\\">\\n            <strong>Lead magnet</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Get the \\\"7-Minute Daily Ritual\\\" with your first message. It's a gentle practice to create momentum.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"small\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • Crafted guidance by {{COACH_NAME}} • <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">Privacy</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Decorative pattern (local svg) -->\\n  <svg style=\\\"position:fixed;right:-120px;bottom:-120px;opacity:0.12;pointer-events:none\\\" width=\\\"480\\\" height=\\\"480\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 600\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#c9a86b\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.18\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#8cc0a5\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"600\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" rx=\\\"90\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n  </svg>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# Contact Page — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n\\nThis chunk includes the contact page and a README describing how to integrate it into the full site.\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html — The gallery-style contact template designed for the \\\"lux_gallery\\\" layout.\\n\\nPurpose and notes:\\n- The contact page intentionally ripples key sections that must appear across the site: hero, diagnostic, plan, micro_habits, pricing, and CTA. Each section is presented succinctly so users can engage directly from the contact page.\\n- Local SVG artwork is referenced at `assets/img/hero.svg` and `assets/img/avatar.svg`. Ensure those assets exist in the project assets folder (these were created in another chunk).\\n- The page uses placeholders that must be replaced at build or runtime:\\n  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n  - {{TAGLINE}}\\n  - {{PHONE}}\\n  - {{EMAIL}}\\n  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n  - {{COACH_NAME}}\\n  - {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n  - {{CITY}}\\n  - {{STATE}}\\n\\nBehavior and forms:\\n- The diagnostic form posts to `/capture-diagnostic` and the contact form posts to `/contact`. Hook these endpoints to your backend or to a form handler of choice.\\n- The contact form includes fields for name, phone, email, interest, and a short message. The lead magnet (\\\"7-Minute Daily Ritual\\\") is offered when visitors submit a message.\\n\\nDesign considerations:\\n- Lux_gallery styling: gallery imagery (SVG), restrained color accents, generous spacing.\\n- Voice: spiritual_teacher — warm, grounded, outcome-oriented language focused on habits, frameworks, and micro-practices without medical claims.\\n\\nCustomization:\\n- Update primary accent colors in the inline CSS variables to match brand.\\n- Replace the placeholder SVGs with the finalized art in `assets/img/` as needed.\\n- Update form action targets to point at your CRM or scheduling system.\\n\\nAccessibility & responsiveness:\\n- The layout is responsive and will stack on smaller screens.\\n- Ensure SVG alt attributes and link labels are updated for final copy.\\n\\nIntegration tips:\\n- Keep nav links in sync with other pages (index.html, about.html, services.html, programs.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html).\\n- The required section pack appears on the index and is referenced throughout the site; this contact page mirrors those sections to aid conversion and reduce friction for users who land directly on contact.\\n\\nIf you need a variant (e.g., lighter background, different CTA language, or alternate micro-habits), provide the desired tone and I will generate a second version.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
